  "notes": "Lastech's layout (Thara and Padma, Copyright 1992 Lastech, converted by ALLTYPE). Not the Wijesekara layout: worked out by rendering each glyph and comparing it with Unicode Sinhala. Only the glyphs identified with confidence are mapped: most consonants, the independent vowels අ ඉ ඊ උ, the vowel signs, al-lakuna, anusvara (U+2026, Windows-1252 0x85) and visarga (U+2020, 0x86). Not mapped yet, reported unmapped: ඛ ඞ ඟ ඣ ඤ ඥ ට ඨ ඪ ධ ඬ ඳ ඵ භ ඹ ෆ, ඔ ඕ එ ඒ, ෘ ෟ, rakaransaya, yansaya and the consonant + vowel ligatures on high code points. Padma has the same glyphs on the same codes as Thara, plus a few more.",
